{"result":"{
  "id": "18160",
  "key": "SFCC-101",
  "summary": "PDP – Slide out - Measmerize Widget & Find My Size CTA",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to find my recommended size on the product page,\n\n**so that** I can select the right size with confidence before adding to bag.\n\n----\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):** \n\n![\"image-20260716-005925.png\"](image-20260716-005925.png)\n\n*Please note - the new design of Measmerize is not in our control - Measmerize is responsible for the look and feel within the widget.*\n\n**Image of current widget for reference, in case new design is not yet picked up by Measmerize:**\n\n![\"image-20260716-012029.png\"](image-20260716-012029.png)\n\nThe PDP always displays a Find My Size CTA. When Measmerize is configured for the product, clicking the CTA opens the Measmerize widget. Where Measmerize is not configured for a product, clicking the CTA opens the SFCC size guide slide-out (covered in a separate story).\n\nOnce Measmerize has generated a size recommendation for the shopper, the shopper can click on Continue and that size will be selected in the PDP.\n\nThe Measmerize script is loaded on the PDP via script injection.\n\n**Integration details:**\n\n- Integration guide: https://docs.measmerize.com/\n- Username: doc-measmerize-com\n- Password: th-a6e2?sd?Pxf9FYHBvCZ\n- Brand IDs:\n      - **Staging**: b38fac52-7328-45c9-9fd8-038fac4be58e\n      - **Production**: 131b0b3c-1578-4fb0-a7b9-c46cd634843d",
